post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
pi-ext-claude-bridge needs two pieces of user configuration:

  1. ~/.pi/agent/claude-bridge.json
     { "provider": { "pathToClaudeCodeExecutable": "/usr/bin/claude" } }

  2. ~/.pi/agent/settings.json
     "extensions": ["/usr/share/pi/extensions"]

Then sign in with `claude auth login` and pick a claude-bridge/... model in pi.

Other Pi extensions packaged by other maintainers install into the same root, so
one entry covers those too.

If your settings still name /usr/lib/pi/packages, replace that entry: the
extensions now install under /usr/share.
EOF
}
